      "module": "lesen",
      "title": "A Family Trip to the Mountains",
      "text": "Last summer, my family decided to go on a trip to the mountains. We wanted to spend some time away (1) __________ the busy city. We packed our bags and drove for five hours until we reached a small village. The air was so fresh (2) __________ it felt like we were breathing for the first time. On the second day, we went hiking. My brother, (3) __________ loves taking photos, brought his new camera with him. We climbed a steep path, and although it was quite difficult, the view from the top was worth (4) __________ effort. We sat down to eat our picnic lunch while looking at the snowy peaks. It was (5) __________ of the best days of my life. I really hope we can go back there (6) __________ year.",
